{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "story_brigid_set_1_story_1",
  "groupId": "story_brigid_set_1",
  "stageId": null,
  "title": "臨行日",
  "storyCode": null,
  "avgTag": "幕間",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_brigid_1_1.txt",
  "sourceHash": "1333ade0c2c13daed0614e0a93c8381474e3237f7904cdd192cf5acb4df70c5f",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_wild_m"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "馱獸",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1163_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（嗅聞）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "馱獸",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1163_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（走動）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "馱獸",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1163_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（用蹄子拍打地面）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "馱獸",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1163_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哞——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4177_brigid_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎麼了？你發現什麼了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "馱獸",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1163_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哞哞——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4177_brigid_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有人？在哪個方向，帶我過去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4177_brigid_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這次我們提前通知到了啊，周圍也撤離得很及時，剛才一路過來看到的房子基本都早就清空，照理來說應該不會有人沒趕上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "馱獸",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1163_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哞——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4177_brigid_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就是這裡嗎？可是我什麼也沒看到。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "馱獸",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1163_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（用鼻子頂廢墟上的石塊）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4177_brigid_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "欸，先別動了！雖然我看不見，但萬一真的有活人在這下面呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4177_brigid_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "大個子，讓開一點。讓我過去，別傻傻地擋在那裡了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4177_brigid_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你好？能聽見嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4177_brigid_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我是遊牧人布莉吉，要是你聽得見，也能動彈的話，就找個硬一點的東西，像我這樣輕輕敲一下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "靜謐，長久的靜謐，布莉吉幾乎要以為她的馱獸夥伴只是判斷錯誤了。她環視四周，看到不遠處倒塌的房屋、散開的物資包……\n距離天災發生已經過去至少二十四個小時，能搜救到倖存者的機率本來就渺茫。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4177_brigid_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……好吧，應該是沒有活人。大個子，你是不是找錯了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "馱獸",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1163_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（憤怒地用蹄子拍打地面）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4177_brigid_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我知道，我知道！但這不是沒聲音嗎？可能有什麼東西誤導了你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "馱獸",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1163_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哞——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4177_brigid_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等等……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_4177_brigid_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（輕敲石磚）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_4177_brigid_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（模糊的人聲）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4177_brigid_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……真的有人！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4177_brigid_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我在，我在！跟我說說話吧，你周圍有光線嗎？只有一個人？還是說——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_4177_brigid_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——女兒——"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "布莉吉趴下去，把耳朵貼到能更清晰地聽見聲音的石塊邊緣。她用力往地面上湊，試圖辨別倖存者所發出的每一個音節。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女人的聲音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "救……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4177_brigid_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你可能還要說得更清楚一點！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女人的聲音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "救救……我的女兒……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4177_brigid_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你的女兒？你們下面現在是有兩個人，對嗎？你女兒狀態怎麼樣，在你身邊嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "一陣瑣碎的響動之後，女人的聲音更清晰了些。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女人的聲音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這周圍都是黑的，我看不清……我們都被埋在下面……她暈過去了，我不知道……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女人的聲音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "求求你，救救我們——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4177_brigid_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你女兒在你附近嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女人的聲音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是的，是的……她就在我懷裡，我們被壓在石塊下面——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4177_brigid_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你抱著她？那你深呼吸，然後仔細聽，感受她。她是不是還在呼吸，是不是還很溫暖？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女人的聲音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……呃……是、是的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4177_brigid_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好，那接下來，你要一直跟我說話。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4177_brigid_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "人在精神突然放鬆之後也很容易昏過去，所以我需要你慢慢和我說話。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4177_brigid_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "說點什麼吧，隨便說點什麼。比如你女兒多大了，你的頭髮是什麼顏色……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "遊牧人從地上輕巧地爬起來，取下身上的鈴鐺，舉起來，往更開闊的地方走出幾步。\n在鈴聲和風聲中，她向同樣遊蕩在原野上的同伴發出求援的訊息。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女人的聲音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……我女兒，三歲大了，我的頭髮是紅色的……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4177_brigid_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "種族呢？我是佩洛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女人的聲音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "菲林……我和女兒都是菲林……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4177_brigid_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你叫什麼名字？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女人的聲音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我叫伊芙琳……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4177_brigid_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯，你女兒呢——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女人的聲音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你說什麼？我聽不清了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女人的聲音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "遊牧人，遊牧人？你還在嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4177_brigid_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我在，我在向我的同伴求援。你很勇敢，你保護了她，現在，只要等我的同伴過來，我們就能把你們一起救出來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女人的聲音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "什麼？還要等……？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女人的聲音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不……沒有，沒有時間了……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4177_brigid_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有的！你還有精神，女兒也活著，就在你懷裡。這裡能夠準確定位，目前也沒有餘震跡象……你們都能得救的，相信我！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女人的聲音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可我——可我感覺不到我的腿，就算出去了也只是個廢人！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4177_brigid_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "什——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女人的聲音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以，別管我，也別等你的同伴了，求求你，遊牧人，就只是幫我把孩子救出去——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女人的聲音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "求你了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4177_brigid_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就算雙腿不在了，可是你的眼睛還在，雙手還在。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4177_brigid_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你還能用眼睛去看，用手去觸摸。你從天災裡保護了自己的女兒，卻要在這裡……把她拋下？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4177_brigid_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "為什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女人的聲音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，遊牧人，你不懂。你不懂……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4177_brigid_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "也許我是不懂，但你可以解釋給我聽。“一直跟我說話”，記得嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4177_brigid_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但你要慢慢說，不要像剛才那樣大聲，不然很快就會口乾舌燥，沒有力氣的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女人的聲音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_4177_brigid_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……布莉吉？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4177_brigid_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4177_brigid_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "涅梅絲！你收到我的訊息了？你來得好快！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "涅梅絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1692_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "訊息？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4177_brigid_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就是我之前教你聽風的方法，你忘了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4177_brigid_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不對，你肯定記得，不然也不會這麼準確就找到我在哪裡。但這都不重要，你來得正好，快過來這邊——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深池士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_244",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“守靈人”，我們的任務很緊急，不能耽誤時間了……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "涅梅絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1692_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我記得，沒關係。這是我的朋友，一位塔拉的遊牧民。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4177_brigid_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "涅梅絲，你身邊這些士兵……？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "涅梅絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1692_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "深池的救援小隊，我們從納斯爾紗一起過來的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4177_brigid_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4177_brigid_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "總之你們是來救人的，對不對？雖然附近那個小型移動城市的居民們已經安全撤離了，但還有人沒趕上，我發現了兩個倖存者。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "涅梅絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1692_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就在這片區域的下方嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4177_brigid_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "對，就在我剛才站的那塊地方。一對母女，媽媽還有意識，能說話，女兒也還活著，只是昏過去了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "涅梅絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1692_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我猜接下來你還要去其他地方繼續檢查。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4177_brigid_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是啊，要去的。我發出訊息就是想讓在附近的同伴過來，幾個人一起行動總快過一個，之後也好趕快去別的地方看看。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "涅梅絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1692_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那麼，現在我們來了。你可以先去其他地方，深池會接手這裡的救援。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深池士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_244",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“守靈人”，“校官”交代的救援任務——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "涅梅絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1692_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我知道，但這下面也有兩位塔拉倖存者，而深池是塔拉的深池，不是嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "涅梅絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1692_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們接手這裡的救援，你覺得這樣可以嗎，布莉吉？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4177_brigid_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "當然可以啊。反正我們以前也這樣合作過，而且你現在還有更多幫手，也用不上我了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4177_brigid_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "跟我來吧，我把具體位置指給你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "涅梅絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1692_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……可以分頭行動，留一部分人在這裡實施救援，另一部分人跟我——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深池士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_244",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“守靈人”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "涅梅絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1692_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你語氣很焦慮。那對母女的情況怎麼樣？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深池士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_244",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "整體情況和那個遊牧民走之前說的差不多，但就算現在所有人一起清理碎石，騰出保障兩個人安全的空間再行施救，都需要很多時間。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深池士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_244",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們這次主要的任務……那群被維多利亞人圍住的難民可能等不了太久。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "涅梅絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1692_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以甚至不能分頭行動，否則速度更慢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深池士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_244",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是。而且那個母親堅持要跟你說話，她說要找這裡能做決定的人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "涅梅絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1692_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "涅梅絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1692_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那就讓我來跟她溝通吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_wild_a"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4177_brigid_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……這裡，我們之前好像來過啊？這不是我們發現那對母女的地方嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4177_brigid_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "涅梅絲他們好像已經撤離了，人也應該早都救走了。大個子，你又帶我繞路，是不是吃得太飽了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "馱獸",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1163_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哞——！哞哞！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "馱獸",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1163_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（衝向前方）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4177_brigid_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "欸，你去哪裡！我也就是說說，你別亂跑！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4177_brigid_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4177_brigid_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4177_brigid_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "廢墟遮擋了深埋其中的軀體，直到走近，布莉吉才從那被土灰覆蓋的灰色面龐上辨認出一絲鮮豔的紅。\n那是女人頭髮的顏色。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4177_brigid_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……伊芙琳？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊芙琳",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（微弱的呼吸聲）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4177_brigid_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "還有呼吸——嘿，伊芙琳！醒醒！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4177_brigid_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "伊芙琳！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊芙琳",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "咳、咳咳、呃……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4177_brigid_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你是伊芙琳嗎？為什麼只有你被留下了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4177_brigid_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……涅梅絲呢？那些深池的人呢？他們本來該救你的——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊芙琳",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "大人……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊芙琳",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……救救我的孩子……帶她走……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊芙琳",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "求求你……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊芙琳",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不要放棄她，也不要回來救我……帶她走！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4177_brigid_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊芙琳",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我已經……告訴過你了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4177_brigid_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你說了什麼，我不知道啊，你得再說一次……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "遊牧人開始用隨身攜帶的工具去挖那些困住女人的碎石磚塊。但一個人的效率畢竟太低，趕不上女人聲音逐漸低迷下去的速度。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊芙琳",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那些石頭……我肯定……感染了……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊芙琳",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就算活下來，也不會被……接納……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊芙琳",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……而且，我的腿……我動不了……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊芙琳",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我只會成為負擔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊芙琳",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呼……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4177_brigid_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不不不，不是這樣的——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4177_brigid_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不是這樣！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊芙琳",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您也……不要靠近我了，大人……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4177_brigid_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我……我——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "“我會救你”、“我能救你”，哪個是自己想說出口的？\n沒有一句能夠實現。布莉吉發現廢墟已經因先前的救援行動而改變了形態，卡在女人腰間的殘磚斷壁既支撐著她，也在逐漸殺死她。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4177_brigid_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……“幾個人一起行動總快過一個”。最快的方法……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4177_brigid_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他們把擋在你頭頂的磚石直接掀開，讓兩側失去支撐，碎石、磚塊，所有的重量都流向卡住你的地方。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4177_brigid_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "因為知道你會保護你的孩子，會撐下來，直到他們從你手中安全地帶走她。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4177_brigid_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是不是？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "現實的諷刺之處在於，正是對孩子的救援導致了眼前母親的無援，就算有人折返回來也無濟於事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4177_brigid_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可涅梅絲，她怎麼能……她怎麼能允許他們這麼做？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4177_brigid_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "明明可以救下兩個人，只是慢一些——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "馱獸",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1163_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（悲鳴）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊芙琳",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "咳……咳咳。別費力了，大人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4177_brigid_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……我——你——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4177_brigid_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你還有什麼想要的嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊芙琳",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯，我聽見他們……叫您，“守靈人”……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4177_brigid_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你在說涅梅絲？我不是她，也不是守靈人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊芙琳",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……我不知道您究竟是不是真的……但……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊芙琳",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等我徹底……嚥了氣……您能不能……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊芙琳",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "能不能用守靈人的方式……埋葬我？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4177_brigid_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊芙琳",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘶……咳……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "女人就快說不出話來了，胸腔像破洞的風箱一樣聳動，卻不具任何效用。\n那個時間很近了，近在眼前。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊芙琳",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "咳呃——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "女人眉頭緊鎖，灰敗的臉竟然因為疼痛而突然泛紅。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊芙琳",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗚……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4177_brigid_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "遊牧人於是停止了無用的挖掘。她抬起手，將自己粗糙帶血的掌心貼上女人扭曲而緊繃的前額。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4177_brigid_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……這樣做，可以嗎？以前我看見涅梅絲——我看見守靈人這樣做過。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4177_brigid_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "安撫病痛中的人們，寬慰失去家人的孩子，像這樣輕輕一撫，所有的痛苦都能驅散。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4177_brigid_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但我的手只是遊牧人的手……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "馱獸",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1163_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（用鼻子頂布莉吉）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4177_brigid_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "大個子，你去貼著伊芙琳，說不定能讓她覺得暖和一點。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊芙琳",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……守靈人？艾娃，你帶走艾娃了嗎？我的女兒——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4177_brigid_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "帶走了，她已經安全了，現在你可以放鬆，別再說話了……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊芙琳",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊——啊……謝謝你……真的謝謝你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4177_brigid_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊芙琳",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "咳、咳，您還在這裡。我想……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4177_brigid_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你還想要什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊芙琳",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我想看看——納斯爾紗——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4177_brigid_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你想看看納斯爾紗。好，我記下了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊芙琳",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃——啊！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊芙琳",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好痛……我好痛……！明明……明明我的腿已經沒有知覺，可是為什麼——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊芙琳",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘶——咳、咳咳咳！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "馱獸",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1163_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哞——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4177_brigid_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "別再說話了……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊芙琳",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……嘶……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4177_brigid_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "睡吧，伊芙琳。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊芙琳",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "咳……啊……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "女人最後重重呼出一口氣，位於地面之上的半個身軀徹底癱軟下去。布莉吉這才發現，她的身體似乎早已被卡在四周的磚石折斷。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4177_brigid_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "馱獸",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1163_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哞——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "馱獸",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1163_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（用力頂布莉吉）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4177_brigid_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我知道，夥計。我們得帶她走，不能讓她留在這裡變成牙獸的食物。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4177_brigid_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以來吧，幫個忙……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4177_brigid_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "讓我們帶她去看看納斯爾紗。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "59_g8_blackforest_n"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "黑林默許了遊牧人的進入。一人一馱獸，帶著逝者來到了森林的邊緣。\n再往前，明亮的、磚砌石鑄的納斯爾紗就佇立在道路的盡頭。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4177_brigid_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呼……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4177_brigid_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "對不起，伊芙琳，我燃起的篝火總是不夠大，沒辦法像你想要的那樣，像守靈人一樣為你還火。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4177_brigid_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而且，我總覺得你沒有感染。感染者在死後身體有可能會爆炸，可是就算我等到天黑，你也只是這麼安靜，什麼反應也沒有。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4177_brigid_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4177_brigid_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而且，就算你感染了，你也不該這樣死的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4177_brigid_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "走在路上的時候，我想過帶你去遺跡裡面，去找真正的守靈人。可是你也說過，你想看看納斯爾紗。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4177_brigid_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以想來想去，最後只能帶你來這裡了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "馱獸",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1163_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（低聲哀鳴）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4177_brigid_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "往好處想想呢？也許……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4177_brigid_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "也許涅梅絲已經帶艾娃回到了納斯爾紗，我把你埋在這裡，既妨礙不到別人，你也能遠遠地看見，甚至聽見她們……也說不定。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "馱獸",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1163_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（叼來野花放在墓前）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4177_brigid_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "大個子，好夥計，去幫我也找點這樣的花來——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4177_brigid_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……算了，我自己去吧。你就在這裡陪著伊芙琳。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "布莉吉走出黑林，來到更開闊的地界上。\n在這裡，樹葉晃動的窸窣聲響不再會擾亂風聲，她得以清晰地向友人傳遞接下來的話語。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4177_brigid_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "離群的守靈人，如果你仍然在聽著……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4177_brigid_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……接下來，摘點花吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4177_brigid_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等花草打成蝴蝶一樣的繩結，涅梅絲就會來的。像以前一樣，翻過遺跡的石牆，穿越燈塔熄滅的海岬……來見我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4177_brigid_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在天亮之前，她會來的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "59_g7_blackforest_d"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "兩束不辨品類的小花，一束用落葉裹起，擺在紅髮女子小小的墳墓前，一束打成繩結，放在席地而坐的遊牧人腳邊。\n她等待，從深夜至黎明，只為消解盤桓胸中的疑惑，直到那些要問的話語都在日出的瞬間失去效力。\n她不再等了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4177_brigid_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "馱獸",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1163_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（用鼻子輕輕頂布莉吉）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4177_brigid_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她沒有來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "馱獸",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1163_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（輕蹭）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4177_brigid_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你說，會不會以前的每次……其實她都是這樣選的？只是我沒有發現。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4177_brigid_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她一直都和其他的守靈人有些不一樣。而從她離開遺跡、離開原野，走進那些架在輪子上的城市後……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4177_brigid_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她就更不一樣了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "馱獸",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1163_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哞、哞哞——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4177_brigid_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我知道，大個子。天已經亮了，她不會來了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4177_brigid_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "走吧！我們也在這裡等得夠久了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "布莉吉在馱獸的支撐下站起身，將繩結留在原地，活動著因寒冷和久坐而僵硬的四肢。\n她將最後一眼投向身旁小小的墳堆，而不是身後為太陽所照耀的移動城市。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4177_brigid_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "再見，伊芙琳。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "在遊牧人早已遠去的身後，另一雙手將那枚乾枯發黃的繩結從地上撿起。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "涅梅絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1692_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "涅梅絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1692_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "布莉吉？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
